<title>NETHERLANDS: Reuters 18th ex-Amsterdam air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 18th ex-Amsterdam air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Amsterdam Dutch guilder air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>			   Jan 22	 Nov 22</p>
<p>		    UNITED STATES</p>
<p> AMS-JFK		 1.50	   1.30</p>
<p> AMS-LAX		 2.25	   2.10</p>
<p> AMS-CHI		 1.70	   1.50</p>
<p>		    ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> AMS-HKG		 2.80	   2.80</p>
<p> AMS-SIN		 2.60	   2.50</p>
<p> AMS-NRT		 4.35	   4.30</p>
<p> AMS-TPE		 2.60	   2.60</p>
<p> AMS-SEL		 4.00	   3.80</p>
<p> AMS-KUL		 2.50	   2.45</p>
<p>		    MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> AMS-DXB		 1.70	   1.65</p>
<p> AMS-BAH		 2.50	   2.40</p>
<p> AMS-MCT		 2.90	   2.70</p>
<p> AMS-AUH		 2.35	   2.10</p>
<p>		    LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> AMS-MEX		 3.60	   3.80</p>
<p> AMS-BOG		 3.70	   3.70</p>
<p> AMS-SCL(CHILE)	5.35	   5.65</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Amsterdan Schiphol airport. *All prices are quoted in Dutch guilders.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. -Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+445 171</p>
